&nbsp;Read the following statements and choose the correct option<br>&nbsp;
<table border="1" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1"><tbody><tr><td><span style="white-space:nowrap;"><strong>Statement A: </strong></span></td><td>Formation of life was preceded by chemical evolution&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><span style="white-space:nowrap;"><strong>Statement B: </strong></span></td><td>First forms of life could have come from pre-existing non-living organic molecules&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table>
&nbsp;

<table border="1" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1"><tbody><tr><td>1.</td><td>Only <strong>statement A </strong>is incorrect&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>2.</td><td>Only <strong>statement B</strong> is incorrect&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>3.</td><td>Both <strong>A</strong> and <strong>B</strong> statements are incorrect&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>4.</td><td>Both <strong>A</strong> and <strong>B</strong> statements are correct</td></tr></tbody></table>

&nbsp;
<table border="1" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1"><tbody><tr><td><strong><span style="white-space:nowrap;">Assertion(A): </span></strong></td><td>After industrialization, dark winged moths became predominant over light winged moths.</td></tr><tr><td><strong><span style="white-space:nowrap;">Reason(R):</span></strong></td><td>During post-industrialization period, the white coloured moths were spotted by predators against the contrasting background of tree-trunks.&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table>
&nbsp;

<table border="1" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1"><tbody><tr><td>1.</td><td>Both <strong>(A) </strong>and <strong>(R) </strong>are true and <strong>(R)&nbsp;</strong>is the correct explanation of <strong>(A) </strong></td></tr><tr><td>2.</td><td>Both <strong>(A) </strong>and <strong>(R) </strong>are true and <strong>(R) </strong>is not the correct explanation of&nbsp;<strong>(A) </strong></td></tr><tr><td>3.</td><td><strong>(A) </strong>is true but <strong>(R) </strong>is false.</td></tr><tr><td>4.</td><td>Both <strong>(A) </strong>and <strong>(R) </strong>are false.</td></tr></tbody></table>
